IoTaWatt custom integration for Home Assistant
https://github.com/No-Signal/ha-iotawatt

This integration is derived from the IoTaWatt integration in Home Assistant core
(https://github.com/home-assistant/core, tag 2026.10.4, commit
357cae5c598dfcd7a0ea7dc5b1facccd4ec6037b), files
homeassistant/components/iotawatt/ and tests/components/iotawatt/.

