Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Modifications have been made to the original files. They are recorded in this
repository's git history; the first commit contains the unmodified core files.

Bundled library
---------------

custom_components/iotawatt/iotawattpy_nosignal/ is a bundled, unmodified
copy of the iotawattpy-nosignal library (https://github.com/No-Signal/iotawattpy,
tag v0.4.0, commit 0cad6532349fc417ad142d3de6b191397f6fe921; see SOURCE.json
in that directory). It is a modified fork of iotawattpy
(https://github.com/home-assistant-libs/iotawattpy), copyright Greg Diehl,
Stefan Agner and contributors, licensed under the GNU General Public License
version 3 or later. Its licence is included as
custom_components/iotawatt/iotawattpy_nosignal/LICENSE. The copy is generated
by script/sync_library.py; it is never edited by hand.

